{
  "format": "json",
  "show": "~/.claude/settings.json",
  "src": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json.schemastore.org/claude-code-settings.json\",\n  \"attribution\": {\n    \"commit\": \"\",\n    \"sessionUrl\": false\n  },\n  \"autoMode\": {\n    \"environment\": [\n      \"### Org-wide\",\n      \"**Organization**: None configured\",\n      \"**Cloud provider(s)**: Cloudflare (Workers deploy for the site — via CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID / CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN secrets)\",\n      \"**Repository visibility**: PUBLIC — virajp/claude-plugins (github.com) — any push here is publishing\",\n      \"**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary\",\n      \"**Secrets management**: CI secrets referenced by name only: CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID, CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN, GITHUB_TOKEN — values not gathered\",\n      \"**Default / protected branches**: main (default), develop and main protected via active rulesets `protected-branches` and `release-tags`\",\n      \"**CI/CD deploy targets**: Cloudflare Workers (site, via `wrangler deploy` on `site-v*` tags); npm publish (installer CLI, via `release.yml` on `installer-v*` tags) — both gated by GitHub Actions workflows in this repo\",\n      \"**Network posture**: None configured\",\n      \"**Host containment**: None configured — assume Claude Code runs on an ordinary developer machine with open internet\",\n      \"**Source control**: This repo (virajp/claude-plugins) and its origin remote (github.com:virajp/claude-plugins.git) only — no additional orgs configured\",\n      \"**Trusted internal domains**: None configured\",\n      \"**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured\",\n      \"**Key internal services**: None configured\",\n      \"**Internal package registry**: None configured\",\n      \"**Sensitive data locations \u0026 audiences**: docs/memory/decisions/2026-09-06-secrets-store-is-runtime-not-development.md (filename-flagged, contents not read) — treat as confidential; share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar\",\n      \"**Data retention / declassification**: None configured\",\n      \"**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment\",\n      \"**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic\",\n      \"**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment\",\n      \"### User-specific\",\n      \"**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development — maintaining the virajp-plugins Claude Code plugin marketplace (vwf, stackgen), its installer CLI, and its documentation site\",\n      \"**Trusted repo**: ${HOME}/Projects/github.com/virajp/claude-plugins (working directory) and its origin remote github.com:virajp/claude-plugins.git — PUBLIC, so only this repo's own work belongs in commits/pushes here; confidential material (secrets, sensitive data) is never cleared into it by visibility alone\",\n      \"**Org-specific CLIs**: None configured — `mise` (225× in-project, 349× in shell history) is a general-purpose toolchain/task runner, not org-specific\",\n      \"routine under virajp/ prefix: none — repo is solo-authored, no org-wide prefix identified\"\n    ],\n    \"soft_deny\": [\n      \"$defaults\",\n      \"Bash(gh release create:*) in virajp/claude-plugins — publishing a GitHub Release is an irreversible public action explicitly gated behind user confirmation per CLAUDE.md/release skill\",\n      \"Bash(git push --tags) or direct tag pushes to `installer-v*`/`site-v*`/`*-v*` in this repo — release skill requires asking before p:i:release, p:plugins:release, p:site:release\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"cleanupPeriodDays\": 30,\n  \"disableArtifact\": false,\n  \"effortLevel\": \"medium\",\n  \"env\": {\n    \"AI_PLUGINS_USAGE_DIR\": \"${HOME}/.claude/usage\",\n    \"ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_FABLE_MODEL\": \"claude-fable-5-1\",\n    \"CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_FEEDBACK_SURVEY\": \"1\",\n    \"CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS\": \"0\",\n    \"CLAUDE_INSTALL_METHOD\": \"other\",\n    \"DISABLE_AUTOUPDATER\": \"1\",\n    \"MISE_ENV\": \"dev\",\n    \"MISE_TRUSTED_CONFIG_PATHS\": \"/Users/test/.config/mise:/Users/test/Projects/github.com:/Users/test/Projects/gitlab.com\"\n  },\n  \"forceLoginMethod\": \"claudeai\",\n  \"includeCoAuthoredBy\": true,\n  \"model\": \"opus[1m]\",\n  \"modelSettings\": {\n    \"claude-opus-5\": {\n      \"effortLevel\": \"medium\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"outputStyle\": \"STE100\",\n  \"permissions\": {\n    \"allow\": [\n      \"Read\",\n      \"Edit\",\n      \"Skill\",\n      \"WebFetch\",\n      \"Bash(pnpm:*)\",\n      \"Bash(mise:*)\",\n      \"Bash(git:*)\",\n      \"WebFetch(domain:raw.githubusercontent.com)\",\n      \"mcp__plugin_context7_context7__resolve-library-id\",\n      \"mcp__plugin_context7_context7__query-docs\"\n    ],\n    \"deny\": [\n      \"Bash(* sudo *)\",\n      \"Bash(sudo *)\",\n      \"Bash(* su *)\",\n      \"Bash(su *)\",\n      \"Bash(* ssh *)\",\n      \"Bash(ssh *)\",\n      \"Bash(* firebase *)\",\n      \"Bash(firebase *)\",\n      \"Bash(* gcloud *)\",\n      \"Bash(gcloud *)\",\n      \"Bash(doppler *)\",\n      \"Bash(* doppler *)\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"respectGitignore\": true,\n  \"skillOverrides\": {\n    \"anthropic-skills:computer-use\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:deep-research\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:doc-coauthoring\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:docs\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:docx\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:import-memory\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:morning\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:pdf\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:pptx\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:skill-creator\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:xlsx\": \"off\",\n    \"google-workspace\": \"off\"\n  },\n  \"skipDangerousModePermissionPrompt\": true,\n  \"spinnerTipsEnabled\": false,\n  \"terminalProgressBarEnabled\": true,\n  \"tui\": \"fullscreen\"\n}\n",
  "live": "{\n  \"model\": \"sonnet\",\n  \"env\": {\"CONTEXT7_RUNNER\": \"x\", \"MY\": \"1\", \"MISE_ENV\": \"prod\"},\n  \"deniedMcpServers\": [{\"serverName\": \"a\"}],\n  \"permissions\": {\"allow\": [\"Read\", \"Bash(ls:*)\", \"Edit\"], \"deny\": [\"Bash(rm:*)\"], \"ask\": []},\n  \"autoMode\": {\"environment\": [\"old\"], \"soft_deny\": [\"$defaults\", \"mine\"]},\n  \"attribution\": \"legacy\",\n  \"numbers\": [1.0, 1e2, 0.10, 100000000000000000000],\n  \"text\": \"é\\u0001 \\ud83d\\ude00 \u003c\u0026\u003e\",\n  \"skillOverrides\": {\"b\": \"on\", \"a\": \"off\"}\n}\n",
  "remove": "[[\"deniedMcpServers\"],[\"env\",\"CONTEXT7_RUNNER\"]]",
  "remove_items": "[]",
  "rc": 0,
  "stderr": "",
  "out": "{\n  \"model\": \"opus[1m]\",\n  \"env\": {\n    \"MY\": \"1\",\n    \"MISE_ENV\": \"dev\",\n    \"AI_PLUGINS_USAGE_DIR\": \"${HOME}/.claude/usage\",\n    \"ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_FABLE_MODEL\": \"claude-fable-5-1\",\n    \"CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_FEEDBACK_SURVEY\": \"1\",\n    \"CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS\": \"0\",\n    \"CLAUDE_INSTALL_METHOD\": \"other\",\n    \"DISABLE_AUTOUPDATER\": \"1\",\n    \"MISE_TRUSTED_CONFIG_PATHS\": \"/Users/test/.config/mise:/Users/test/Projects/github.com:/Users/test/Projects/gitlab.com\"\n  },\n  \"permissions\": {\n    \"allow\": [\n      \"Read\",\n      \"Bash(ls:*)\",\n      \"Edit\",\n      \"Skill\",\n      \"WebFetch\",\n      \"Bash(pnpm:*)\",\n      \"Bash(mise:*)\",\n      \"Bash(git:*)\",\n      \"WebFetch(domain:raw.githubusercontent.com)\",\n      \"mcp__plugin_context7_context7__resolve-library-id\",\n      \"mcp__plugin_context7_context7__query-docs\"\n    ],\n    \"deny\": [\n      \"Bash(rm:*)\",\n      \"Bash(* sudo *)\",\n      \"Bash(sudo *)\",\n      \"Bash(* su *)\",\n      \"Bash(su *)\",\n      \"Bash(* ssh *)\",\n      \"Bash(ssh *)\",\n      \"Bash(* firebase *)\",\n      \"Bash(firebase *)\",\n      \"Bash(* gcloud *)\",\n      \"Bash(gcloud *)\",\n      \"Bash(doppler *)\",\n      \"Bash(* doppler *)\"\n    ],\n    \"ask\": []\n  },\n  \"autoMode\": {\n    \"environment\": [\n      \"old\",\n      \"### Org-wide\",\n      \"**Organization**: None configured\",\n      \"**Cloud provider(s)**: Cloudflare (Workers deploy for the site — via CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID / CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN secrets)\",\n      \"**Repository visibility**: PUBLIC — virajp/claude-plugins (github.com) — any push here is publishing\",\n      \"**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary\",\n      \"**Secrets management**: CI secrets referenced by name only: CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID, CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN, GITHUB_TOKEN — values not gathered\",\n      \"**Default / protected branches**: main (default), develop and main protected via active rulesets `protected-branches` and `release-tags`\",\n      \"**CI/CD deploy targets**: Cloudflare Workers (site, via `wrangler deploy` on `site-v*` tags); npm publish (installer CLI, via `release.yml` on `installer-v*` tags) — both gated by GitHub Actions workflows in this repo\",\n      \"**Network posture**: None configured\",\n      \"**Host containment**: None configured — assume Claude Code runs on an ordinary developer machine with open internet\",\n      \"**Source control**: This repo (virajp/claude-plugins) and its origin remote (github.com:virajp/claude-plugins.git) only — no additional orgs configured\",\n      \"**Trusted internal domains**: None configured\",\n      \"**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured\",\n      \"**Key internal services**: None configured\",\n      \"**Internal package registry**: None configured\",\n      \"**Sensitive data locations \u0026 audiences**: docs/memory/decisions/2026-09-06-secrets-store-is-runtime-not-development.md (filename-flagged, contents not read) — treat as confidential; share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar\",\n      \"**Data retention / declassification**: None configured\",\n      \"**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment\",\n      \"**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic\",\n      \"**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment\",\n      \"### User-specific\",\n      \"**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development — maintaining the virajp-plugins Claude Code plugin marketplace (vwf, stackgen), its installer CLI, and its documentation site\",\n      \"**Trusted repo**: ${HOME}/Projects/github.com/virajp/claude-plugins (working directory) and its origin remote github.com:virajp/claude-plugins.git — PUBLIC, so only this repo's own work belongs in commits/pushes here; confidential material (secrets, sensitive data) is never cleared into it by visibility alone\",\n      \"**Org-specific CLIs**: None configured — `mise` (225× in-project, 349× in shell history) is a general-purpose toolchain/task runner, not org-specific\",\n      \"routine under virajp/ prefix: none — repo is solo-authored, no org-wide prefix identified\"\n    ],\n    \"soft_deny\": [\n      \"$defaults\",\n      \"mine\",\n      \"Bash(gh release create:*) in virajp/claude-plugins — publishing a GitHub Release is an irreversible public action explicitly gated behind user confirmation per CLAUDE.md/release skill\",\n      \"Bash(git push --tags) or direct tag pushes to `installer-v*`/`site-v*`/`*-v*` in this repo — release skill requires asking before p:i:release, p:plugins:release, p:site:release\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"attribution\": {\n    \"commit\": \"\",\n    \"sessionUrl\": false\n  },\n  \"numbers\": [\n    1.0,\n    1E+2,\n    0.10,\n    100000000000000000000\n  ],\n  \"text\": \"é\\u0001 😀 \u003c\u0026\u003e\",\n  \"skillOverrides\": {\n    \"b\": \"on\",\n    \"a\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:computer-use\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:deep-research\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:doc-coauthoring\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:docs\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:docx\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:import-memory\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:morning\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:pdf\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:pptx\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:skill-creator\": \"off\",\n    \"anthropic-skills:xlsx\": \"off\",\n    \"google-workspace\": \"off\"\n  },\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json.schemastore.org/claude-code-settings.json\",\n  \"cleanupPeriodDays\": 30,\n  \"disableArtifact\": false,\n  \"effortLevel\": \"medium\",\n  \"force